														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4826404">
									

<p>I feel like the concept is too basic if that makes any sense. I feel like you got the inspiration for this from SCP-001, and although that story/article is very interesting it’s also very hard to pull off right. There’s always a sense of impending doom in that story/article, which doesn’t seem really present in yours. Along with this there’s always a sense of hope in that article which I think yours needs. Because the whole idea is gravity is increasing and everyone dies, which is quite boring. There’s no way to even try to survive and it feels like you may as well be writing about an SCP which instantly kills everyone with no way to stop it. Plenty of SCP’s talk about world ending events but there’s always some way to survive it. With this, it’s just death.</p>

							</div>

								
					
