			<div class="content" id="post-content-4826389">
									

<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> the basic idea of this SCP is that it is a creature which can only cause harm or interact with things while in pitch black darkness</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> none</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> I think what makes this SCP special is that it plays off of people’s fears of the dark. Now I’m sure many scary things (not just SCP’s) do this, however this is interesting because this creature plays with peoples sanity and likes to toy with them before it kills them. This SCP is more than just a creature which kills you in the dark, it’s also a cognitohazard which drives you insane, and it plays off of your past trauma to scare you immensely before killing you.</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> would it be a cognitohazard?</p>

